    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/f29d35c6409cc7d2bb97f20d4346eda3.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find the right words to say and overcome conflicts in <strong><i>Desta: The Memories Between</i></strong>, a cosy team-based tactics adventure.<br><br>Every night, Desta falls into the mysterious world, filled with shattered remnants of locations past, memories of regret-filled relationships, and dodgeballs that can change the course of conversation and the future of this world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/af21650196833c3eedf5e03dcbc9ec4f.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY TACTICAL, PHYSICS-BASED ENCOUNTERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Overcome tactical challenges with perfect throws, shoot wild trick shots and land sensational hits in turn-based sports-style encounters. As nights progress, Desta becomes experienced and attuned to this surreal world, discovering new abilities and ways to win</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEAM UP WITH POWERFUL FRIENDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brought to life with a full voice cast, Desta meets incredible characters throughout their journey, all with exceptional abilities and powers, each with their own story to tell about their connection to this world</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CHALLENGING NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Once you build up your skills, take on Nightmare Mode for the ultimate hardcore tactics challenge where EVERY throw matters</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dream Team Edition</strong> is the digital collector\u2019s edition of Desta: The Memories Between - compiling all major content updates together, including all characters, new game modes (including Challenge Mode and Nightmare Mode), as well a complete game soundtrack composed by acclaimed UK Artist Mansur Brown and a beautiful Digital Art Book.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/235c1f87e0f0b03bc29ebf1d606f1418.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure</strong></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/f29d35c6409cc7d2bb97f20d4346eda3.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/784094ca85fd1be716087b68de93f7b1.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find the right words to say and overcome conflicts in <strong><i>Desta: The Memories Between</i></strong>, a cosy team-based tactics adventure.<br><br>Every night, Desta falls into the mysterious world, filled with shattered remnants of locations past, memories of regret-filled relationships, and dodgeballs that can change the course of conversation and the future of this world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/af21650196833c3eedf5e03dcbc9ec4f.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY TACTICAL, PHYSICS-BASED ENCOUNTERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Overcome tactical challenges with perfect throws, shoot wild trick shots and land sensational hits in turn-based sports-style encounters. As nights progress, Desta becomes experienced and attuned to this surreal world, discovering new abilities and ways to win</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEAM UP WITH POWERFUL FRIENDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brought to life with a full voice cast, Desta meets incredible characters throughout their journey, all with exceptional abilities and powers, each with their own story to tell about their connection to this world</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CHALLENGING NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Once you build up your skills, take on Nightmare Mode for the ultimate hardcore tactics challenge where EVERY throw matters</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dream Team Edition</strong> is the digital collector\u2019s edition of Desta: The Memories Between - compiling all major content updates together, including all characters, new game modes (including Challenge Mode and Nightmare Mode), as well a complete game soundtrack composed by acclaimed UK Artist Mansur Brown and a beautiful Digital Art Book.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.poster.avif?t=1700826562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.webm?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.mp4?t=1700826562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/235c1f87e0f0b03bc29ebf1d606f1418.avif?t=1700826562\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure</strong></i>",
    "short_description": "Fall into a beautiful and puzzling dreamworld. Find your friends, unlock spectacular abilities and overcome the odds in a surreal tactical dodgeball adventure to uncover the mysteries of a broken world from the creators of Monument Valley.",
